      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lodo. Nascidos do lodo, esses Pokémon agora se reúnem em lugares poluídos e aumentam a quantidade de bactérias em seus corpos. Quando os corpos de dois Grimer se misturam, novos venenos são criados.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Grimer pode evoluir para Muk no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Poison Gas, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Harden</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Sludge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Mud Bomb, Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Minimize</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Fling, Toxic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Sludge Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Sludge Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Gunk Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Acid Armor, Belch, Memento</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Attract, Body Slam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Endure, Explosion, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Punch, Flamethrower, Fling, Frustration, Giga Drain, Gunk Shot, Haze, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Imprison, Infestation, Metronome, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Pain Split, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Venoshock, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid Spray, Curse, Haze, Imprison, Lick, Mean Look, Power-Up Punch, Scary Face, Shadow Punch, Shadow Sneak, Spit Up, Stockpile, Swallow</p>",
